  finalStoryText: "Once upon a time, there was a kid named Judy. Judy went walking
    into the forest, stomp, stomp, stomp. Then Judy heard something\u2026 Yip yip!
    It was a little fox, running fast. Its tail was soft, soft like a pillow. Judy
    and the fox became friends right away. Suddenly, the sky got dark. Tap tap tap,
    like tiny drums. The rain was cold, and it tickled Judy\u2019s nose. \u201CQuick,
    follow me!\u201D said Judy. Judy and the fox ran together. They found a tree,
    super big, bigger than Judy\u2019s house. Shhh shhh, the leaves whispered as
    the rain came down. Judy and the fox hid underneath, all cozy and dry. And they
    listened to the rain and the whispering tree until it was time to go home. The
    end."
  finalStory:
  - id: prepared-story
    caption: "Once upon a time, there was a kid named Judy. Judy went walking into
      the forest, stomp, stomp, stomp. Then Judy heard something\u2026 Yip yip! It
      was a little fox, running fast. Its tail was soft, soft like a pillow. Judy
      and the fox became friends right away. Suddenly, the sky got dark. Tap tap
      tap, like tiny drums. The rain was cold, and it tickled Judy\u2019s nose. \u201CQuick,
      follow me!\u201D said Judy. Judy and the fox ran together. They found a tree,
      super big, bigger than Judy\u2019s house. Shhh shhh, the leaves whispered as
      the rain came down. Judy and the fox hid underneath, all cozy and dry. And
      they listened to the rain and the whispering tree until it was time to go home.
      The end."
